      "writtenOn": "2018-12-06T18:05:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I also ever considered this case. I tested xt_tag + non-offload case.\nI found this logic\n\n################\nprivate class NetdTetheringStatsProvider extends ITetheringStatsProvider.Stub {\n    @Override\n    public NetworkStats getTetherStats(int how) {\n        // We only need to return per-UID stats. Per-device stats are already counted by\n        // interface counters.\n        if (how !\u003d STATS_PER_UID) {\n            return new NetworkStats(SystemClock.elapsedRealtime(), 0);\n        }\n\n#################\nso when we invoke getNetworkStatsTethering(STATS_PER_IFACE), will return all Zero from netd.\nthen will not double count the tether usage.",
